<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50249" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκεσ-ία</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκέτης</span>) (replaced by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκετεία</span> in 
			Att.
		, cf. <i><span class="en">
			Phryn.
			3
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>PS</u>
			p.77
		</span></i>
		<i><span class="en">
			B.
		</span></i>, but found in <i><span class="en">
			<u>IG</u>
			12.434
		</span></i>; used later, <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			781.11
		</span></i> (Nysa, <span class="entity">i B.C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
			888.11
		</span></i> (Scaptopara, <span class="entity">iii A.D.</span>), etc.):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>the prayer of a suppliant,
				supplication</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1337
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				11.8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				5.215
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς παντοίαν ἱ. τραπῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					20.14
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκεσίαισι σαῖς</span> at thy
				<i>entreaties</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				91
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκεσίας ποιεῖσθαι</span>, on
			behalf of the state, <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				3.121
			</span></i>; = Lat. <i>supplicatio</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				8.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱκέτευμα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Them.</u>
				24
			</span></i>. [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῐ</span>, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> metri gr. in
			<u>AP</u> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				Procl.
				<u>H.</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>.]</div>
